# Shared Supabase database

This app shares Supabase project **Apps** (`yzyipxvlsoxfphwobfkb`) with other CursorSites apps. Each app uses its own schema (`familytree` here) and its own Storage bucket (`familytree`). The migration history table is global.

## Schema changes

1. Write SQL that only touches the `familytree` schema (and the `familytree` bucket row in `storage.buckets`).
2. `supabase migration new <snake_name>` and put the SQL in the new file under `supabase/migrations/`.
3. Apply with MCP **`apply_migration`** on project `yzyipxvlsoxfphwobfkb` (same SQL). Do **not** run `supabase db push` – remote history includes other apps' migrations that are not in this repo.
4. Verify with **`execute_sql`**. Commit the local migration file.

Never repair/revert other apps' remote migration versions to unblock push.

## Edge Functions

`supabase functions deploy familytree-api --no-verify-jwt` is independent of migration history.

Canonical write-up: `../cursor-sites-shared/supabase/SHARED_DATABASE.md`
